## Chapter 04: JavaScript Operators

![Illustration of JavaScript operator categories](assets/images/javascript-operators.svg)

Operators act on values to assign, calculate, compare, combine conditions, and choose between expressions. These lessons include practical examples and interview-style questions, including the difference between loose (`==`) and strict (`===`) equality.

Lessons: [`19_Arch.js`](04_chapter_js_operators/19_Arch.js), [`20_AssignmentOps.js`](04_chapter_js_operators/20_AssignmentOps.js), [`21_Arithmetic_OP.js`](04_chapter_js_operators/21_Arithmetic_OP.js), [`22_Comparison_OP.js`](04_chapter_js_operators/22_Comparison_OP.js), [`23_Logica_Op.js`](04_chapter_js_operators/23_Logica_Op.js), [`24_Confusing_Comparison.js`](04_chapter_js_operators/24_Confusing_Comparison.js), [`25_CC.js`](04_chapter_js_operators/25_CC.js), [`26_Questions.js`](04_chapter_js_operators/26_Questions.js), [`27_Strings.js`](04_chapter_js_operators/27_Strings.js), [`28_Ternary_OP.js`](04_chapter_js_operators/28_Ternary_OP.js), [`29_T_OP.js`](04_chapter_js_operators/29_T_OP.js), [`30-IQ.js`](04_chapter_js_operators/30-IQ.js), [`31_IQ.js`](04_chapter_js_operators/31_IQ.js), [`32_IQ.js`](04_chapter_js_operators/32_IQ.js), [`33_IQ.js`](04_chapter_js_operators/33_IQ.js), [`34_Netsed_Ternary.js`](04_chapter_js_operators/34_Netsed_Ternary.js), [`35_IQ.js`](04_chapter_js_operators/35_IQ.js), [`36_IQ.js`](04_chapter_js_operators/36_IQ.js), and [`37_TypeOf.js`](04_chapter_js_operators/37_TypeOf.js).

