## Chapter 06: If/Else Conditions

![Handwritten-style study note about JavaScript if and else conditions](assets/images/notes-if-else.svg)

Use `if` and `else` to choose a path based on a true-or-false condition. The lessons build from a simple condition to nested and multiple branches.

Lessons: [`46_if.js`](06_chapter_if_else_statement_conditions/46_if.js), [`47_if_else_nested.js`](06_chapter_if_else_statement_conditions/47_if_else_nested.js), [`48_To_if_else.js`](06_chapter_if_else_statement_conditions/48_To_if_else.js), and [`49_Multiple_if_else.js`](06_chapter_if_else_statement_conditions/49_Multiple_if_else.js).

